<title>USA: Galconda sets reverse split, name change.</title>
<headline>Galconda sets reverse split, name change.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galconda Corp said Friday it will implement a one-for-ten reverse split of its common stock, effective Friday.</p>
<p>Separately, the company announced it has changed its corporate name to Jax International Inc. The company stock symbol will also change, to JAXI on the Nasdaq Bulletin Board.</p>
